      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mcQV1blZZGdTiUX4cVsdf4Vy1SlQ-i1uoE3AVa33Ptbpk4q41f12BxxTp0ggs_2KzTew=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Mongolia may be one of the clearest examples of how geography still shapes an entire way of life. The distance, climate, livestock, and seasonal movement all influence how people live in ways most modern cities have almost forgotten.",
      "likeCount": 2,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-26T02:19:52Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
