          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/UT4yqZ2DrZ2fBIIQWOCcVrQYBje265v4HWuZn65ElT3j5IRtHyIw-Ezzb6kX6kLSxPFTaiT5EkE=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "Spot on! When the landscape dictates your survival every single day, it truly redefines what freedom and resilience mean. Thank you for such an insightful comment!",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-09-26T04:19:58Z"
        }
      ]
