          "text": "Absolutely! 🐎 Mongolia’s endless open landscapes make that sense of freedom feel almost tangible. Would you rather spend a few days riding across the steppe or stay with a nomadic family in a traditional ger?",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-09-25T14:53:01Z"
