      "text": "Mongolia feels like one of the last places where freedom still has a physical meaning. Me complaining about 5°C weather vs. a Mongolian nomad drinking hot Airag at -40°C in a Ger. Respect! 😂 Living in cold climates teaches you real discipline!",
